  Keys

    <N> Enter   open entry N (selects at once when unambiguous)
    ↑ ↓ / j k   move, Enter to open
    r<N>        resume project N's most recent session
    p<N>        pick a session to resume for project N
    x<N>        remove project N (asks first)
    n           new project
    c           edit config
    Esc         clear input / close help / quit
    q           quit

    ? to go back

  › 
